id: FL-SEC-010
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: block
title: Flask/Werkzeug debug mode RCE (CVE-2023-27524)
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .py
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ .git/ build/ venv/ .venv/
  content_contains: flask
patterns:
  - regex: app\.run\(.*debug\s*=\s*True
    message: "Flask debug mode enabled — Werkzeug debugger allows arbitrary Python execution from browser"
  - regex: FLASK_DEBUG\s*=\s*(?:1|True|true)
    message: "FLASK_DEBUG enabled — debug mode allows RCE via Werkzeug debugger (CVE-2023-27524)"
fix: Never enable debug mode in production. Use FLASK_ENV=production and a proper WSGI server (gunicorn, uwsgi).
